  ## Accept Order — Cancelled

  Tests accepting a CANCELLED order.
  Replace `CANCELLED_ORDER_UUID` with an order that is already CANCELLED.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Order cannot be accepted because it is CANCELLED"
}
